  "notes": [
    "moneyNumber is the only permitted bounded bigint-to-number money boundary. Every conversion rejects beyond signed MAX_SAFE.",
    "Checkout evaluator guards prices before createCheckout commitments; wallet per-order posting plans validate before ledger writes.",
    "Payment finalizeBuyerCoins is called by applyPaymentStateTransition inside PaymentService.handleWebhook repository callback transaction. A debt check after upsert is covered by that transaction, not by an autocommit rollback claim.",
    "Analytics sort Number(av/bv) is used only when neither operand is bigint; revenue values take exact bigint comparator.",
    "Catalog spec NUMBER is arbitrary product attribute data, not price. Non-money counts/rating/config conversions remain.",
    "Search/query min/max remain bounded numeric operational contracts; public prices, ledger totals, report totals and all Prisma bigint values use exact string DTOs."
  ]
